Third-party components retain their own licenses:

- Build infrastructure adapted from the Metroid Fusion decompilation
  (https://github.com/metroidret/mf), MIT, Copyright (c) 2025 YohannDR.
  Files derived from upstream mf (some verbatim, some adapted):
    Makefile, make_tools.mk, check_roms.sh, permuter_settings.toml,
    tools/extractor.py, tools/permuter_compile.sh, tools/permuter_prelude.inc,
    CONTRIBUTING.md (template), and the overall project skeleton.
  The upstream MIT notice applies to those portions; see
  https://github.com/metroidret/mf/blob/main/LICENSE for the full text.

- tools/preproc/ — pret charmap preprocessor, MIT. Full license in
  tools/preproc/LICENSE. One local patch for Apple-clang's
  -Werror=sometimes-uninitialized.

- tools/gbafix/ — pret/gba-tools gbafix utility, GPL. Full license in
  tools/gbafix/COPYING. Used as a standalone runtime tool (not linked
  into project code).

- tools/agent/bin/objdiff-cli — prebuilt binary from
  https://github.com/encounter/objdiff, Apache License 2.0,
  Copyright 2022 Luke Street.

- tools/agent/prompts/ and the related craft_prompt.py /
  compile_and_view_assembly.py — adapted from Mizuchi
  (https://github.com/macabeus/mizuchi), MIT, Copyright (c) 2025
  macabeus. Per-file attribution headers and full notice in
  tools/agent/prompts/ATTRIBUTION.md.

- agbcc — a local dependency (clone of pret/agbcc), not vendored in
  this repo. See its repository for licensing (mixed; mostly GPL —
  gcc-derived).
